# Implementation Plan - Pagination and Clear All Fixes

Fixing two bugs: pagination on the medicines page to show all records (700+) and resolving foreign key errors in the clear-all API endpoint.

## Proposed Changes

### [API] Clear All Medicines
Modify the deletion order to ensure child records (SaleItem, PurchaseItem, etc.) are deleted before their parents (InventoryBatch, Medicine).

#### [MODIFY] [route.ts](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/api/medicines/clear-all/route.ts)
- Reorder deletions: `saleItem`, `purchaseItem`, `return`, `medicineReturn`, `stockLedger`, `inventoryBatch`, `medicine`.
- Ensure `shopId` filter is used consistently.

### [Frontend] Medicines Dashboard Pagination
Implement pagination in the medicines list to handle large datasets.

#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/medicines/page.tsx)
- Add `currentPage` and `pageSize` state.
- Update [loadMedicines](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/medicines/page.tsx#182-198) to pass `offset` and `limit` to the API.
- Update API response handling to extract `total` count.
- Add pagination controls (Next/Previous, "Showing X-Y of Z").

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run lint` and `npm run build`.

### Manual Verification
- Test "Clear All" as Admin and verify database is wiped without errors.
- Verify medicines list shows 50 items and pagination works across 700+ records.
